        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 803871B, Hanover Keyed Entry Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDoralLock 803871B Hanover Handleset is made out of solid brass and come backed by a limited lifetime mechanical warranty. The historic design of the Hanover Entrance Set features an arched top and bottom. The shape is reminiscent of European architectural elements. The coordinating handle features a curved shape. It has an adjustable backset from 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\". Choose from 8 different knobs or levers for the inside trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: matching <a href=\"/products/hanover-dummy-handleset-dorallock-803871bd\">Hanover Dummy Handleset</a> for the inactive side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Hanover Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>5 pin keyway that is Kwikset compatible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Arched Handover Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 12-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Plate Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Plate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Plate Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection of Grip: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable from 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-803871B-specifications.pdf?v=1704262174\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock Handover Single Cylinder Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/door-handing-picture.gif?v=1704352978\" border=\"0\" width=\"410\" height=\"150\" alt=\"door handing - left or right handed lever\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim finish will match the exterior handleset finish that you choose.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
