                "description": "DoralLock 803871B Hanover Keyed Entry Handleset - DoralLock's Hanover Handleset is made out of solid brass and come backed by a limited lifetime mechanical warranty. The historic design of the Hanover Entrance Set features an arched top and bottom. The shape is reminiscent of European architectural elements. The coordinating handle features a curved shape. It has an adjustable backset from 2-3/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 8 different knobs or levers for the inside trim. ",
